This is a modified `ros_comm` implementation that adds adaptors to the base image. 

## Installation
0. Use `dockerfile` to build the new ROS image with adaptors:
```bash
docker build -t rohit-ros .
```

1. To run the docker container:

```bash
docker run -d --gpus all --network host --cgroupns host --name rohit-ros -v ~/robot:/robot rohit-ros:latest sleep infinity
```
